msgstr "GPS atrašanās vieta/ceļš,Augstums,Sirds ritms,Ātrums"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/gpsgraphic.xml
#: rc.cpp:1160
#, fuzzy, kde-format
#| msgid ""
#| "<![CDATA[<b>Speedometer</b> is available for all data sources but "
#| "recommended only for speed; for the map type it represents the "
#| "\"percentage done\" from trimmed start - end).<br>\n"
#| "Note: for type 1 (zoom and center, aka \"follow the dot\"):<br>\n"
#| "* crop values are only valid as a percentage and only the bottom (resp "
#| "left) values\n"
#| "will be taken into consideration as both values (ie: bottom/top) will "
#| "need to be equal to\n"
#| "keep the dot centered)<br>\n"
#| "* if data source is not GPS location, the centering will only be done for "
#| "horizontal axis\n"
#| "(time), vertical axis crop will behave just like for the basic 2D map "
#| "line (it will statically keep\n"
#| "the same min/max limit allowing the Now dot to move up and down).]]>"
msgid ""
"<b>Speedometer</b> is available for all data sources but recommended only "
"for speed; for the map type it represents the \"percentage done\" from "
"trimmed start - end).<br>\n"
"Note: for type 1 (zoom and center, aka \"follow the dot\"):<br>\n"
"* crop values are only valid as a percentage and only the bottom (resp left) "
"values\n"
"will be taken into consideration as both values (ie: bottom/top) will need "
"to be equal to\n"
"keep the dot centered)<br>\n"
"* if data source is not GPS location, the centering will only be done for "
"horizontal axis\n"
"(time), vertical axis crop will behave just like for the basic 2D map line "
"(it will statically keep\n"
"the same min/max limit allowing the Now dot to move up and down)."
msgstr ""
"<![CDATA[<b>Spidometrs</b> ir pieejams visiem datu avotiem, bet ir ieteicams "
"to izmantot tikai ātrumam. Kartes tipam tas parāda „pieveikto distanci "
"procentuāli“ no noteiktā starta līdz beigām.<br>\n"
"Ievērībai: pirmajam tipam (tuvinājums un centrs jeb „sekot punktam“):<br>\n"
"* kadrēšanas vērtības ir derīgs tikai procentuāli, kā arī programma ņems "
"vērā un tikai apakšējās\n"
"(proti, kreisās puses) vērtības, jo abām vērtībām (apakšējai/augšējai) jābūt "
"vienādām, lai\n"
"punkts atrastos centrā)<br>\n"
"* ja datu avots nav GPS atrašanās vieta, centrēšana būs pieejama tikai "
"horizontālajai asij\n"
"(laiks), bet vertikālās ass kadrēšana notiks gluži kā pamata 2D kartes "
"līnijai (tā statistiski paturēs\n"
"to pašu min./maks. robežu, ļaujot atrašanās punktam pārvietoties augšup un "
"lejup).]]>"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/gpsgraphic.xml
